- On EVERY request the backend must authenticate (valid, unexpired, untampered) and authorize (user may access x-region, role may do the operation), then run CRUD only against that region's DB/HZ.
- Zero cross-user / cross-region leakage. Fail closed. Keep the current log format and add what's missing.

